        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silver, from combined gold-silver production, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silver, from combined gold-silver production, at refinery
This data set describes the composition of silver production from auriferous ores at a global level.;
CAS number: 007440-22-4; 
UUID: 1d46469c-546c-3396-a531-39d825345fe7
none
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Assumption on classification of the production countries has been made, based on global production statistics.
Time period: Period of public statistics
Production volume: 2362 t silver from auriferous ores
Sampling: Production statistics, based on average production rate 2000-2004 
Extrapolations: The energy use, materials, emissions and land use of the mining and beneficiation are considered in the corresponding datasets at country level. 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1d46469c-546c-3396-a531-39d825345fe7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
